{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08918","headline":"鞠歌行 · 李白","name":"鞠歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽莫似汉宫妃，谦莫似黄家女。\n黄女持谦齿发高，汉妃恃丽天庭去。\n人生容德不自保，圣人安用推天道。\n君不见蔡泽嵌枯诡怪之形状，大言直取秦丞相。\n又不见田千秋才智不出人，一朝富贵如有神。\n二侯行事在方册，泣麟老人终困厄。\n夜光抱恨良叹悲，日月逝矣吾何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}